L305@P18: 4.2.12 Pre-defined groups
L306@P18: A package always possesses two pre-defined groups named own and all. The own group contains, by definition, all
L307@P18: elements defined within the package. The all group contains, by definition, all element defined and imported (directly
L308@P18: or not) by the package. It is consequently the union of the own group with all dynamically imported elements.
L309@P18: These groups cannot be removed from the package.
